sub:assertion {
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-beane-planarian-hk-atpase-anterior> pk:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-beane-planarian-hk-atpase-anterior-overall> .
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-beane-planarian-hk-atpase-anterior-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
        rdfs:label "Beane et al. (2011) planarian H,K-ATPase bioelectric V_mem anterior polarity switch — MorphoEval overall 91.1/100" ;
        dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
        dct:description "Pass 2 post-remediation evaluation of `2011-beane-planarian-hk-atpase-anterior.py` (91.3/100, up from 59.2/100 in Pass 1; +32.1 overall). The remediated script couples the cubic bistable membrane potential PDE to Bell-form voltage-gated innexin gap-junction conductance G_GJ(DeltaV) = (1 - eta_oct)*G_0 / (1 + (DeltaV/V_0)^2) and L-type Ca_v-gated anterior/posterior gene transcription, reproducing all 5 canonical Beane et al. (2011) and Oviedo et al. (2010) regeneration phenotypes with zero head-count error (RMSE = 0.0000): Wild-Type `1H1T` (delta_V = +50.5 mV), SCH-28080 / H,K-ATPase RNAi `0H2T` headless, Ivermectin `2H0T` double-headed, 8-Octanol gap-junction blockade `2H0T` double-headed, and Nifedipine Ca_v-block negative control `0H2T`, alongside automated bilateral ocelli segmentation on `schmidtea_mediterranea_specimen.jpg` (N = 2 eyespots at x/L = 0.0528), backed by 3 machine-checked Lean 4 theorems in `Loop_081_planarian_hk_atpase_anterior.lean`. Overall 91.1/100 (faithfulness 90.9, reproducibility 91.7); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit 317bc3c; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 93, Morphological realism / specimen match 89, Parameter expressivity 91, Morphometric validation 91, Source and data traceability 93, Code-to-model traceability 91, Reproducibility package 91. Output judged: docs/media/planarian_hk_atpase_anterior_comparison.png: rendered output of 2011-beane-planarian-hk-atpase-anterior.py at 317bc3c, image/png, 586158 B, 2268×1863 px, artifact_sha256 23e52bef2eb4a12b38ececd73bb5dddfe65c95c72488302a61aea135c94575f8 (sha256 23e52bef2eb4a12b38ececd73bb5dddfe65c95c72488302a61aea135c94575f8), spec_fingerprint c0d35653d229caf892ce95227098738e04e01130c0c0eb1c24a63345a769e0d8. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: c0d35653d229caf892ce95227098738e04e01130c0c0eb1c24a63345a769e0d8; artifact_sha256: 23e52bef2eb4a12b38ececd73bb5dddfe65c95c72488302a61aea135c94575f8; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/planarian_hk_atpase_anterior/paper_citations.bib=4978cdbc97ad314e..., datasets/planarian_hk_atpase_anterior/planarian_hk_atpase_anterior_reference.json=ad7dfa156bbb79fe..., datasets/planarian_hk_atpase_anterior/schmidtea_mediterranea_specimen.jpg=466029cc05610678..., datasets/planarian_hk_atpase_anterior/scout_manifest.json=9de72183ede698f0...}. Supersedes audit: 2026-10-19-planarian-hk-atpase-anterior-audit. Claim boundary: reported_in_source: Beane et al. (2011) Chem. Biol. 18:77-89 H,K-ATPase-mediated anterior blastema membrane depolarization (V_mem) and L-type Ca2+ channel requirement for head regeneration in Schmidtea mediterranea (1H1T wild-type, 0H2T SCH-28080/RNAi headless, 2H0T ivermectin double-head) | Oviedo et al. (2010) Dev. Biol. 339:188-199 & Pietak-Levin (2017) J. R. Soc. Interface 14:20170425 voltage-gated innexin gap-junction coupling G_GJ(DeltaV) and 8-octanol double-head (2H0T) induction; reconstructed_in_script: 1D coupled bistable V_mem + Bell-form voltage-gated gap-junction PDE and mutually antagonistic Head H(x,t) / Tail T(x,t) morphogen cascade across 5 experimental regimes | Automated dorsal body-contour and bilateral photoreceptor ocelli segmentation on schmidtea_mediterranea_specimen.jpg (N=2 eyespots at x/L=0.0528, length=1478 px) and 2D body-plan silhouette synthesis; transfer_boundary: 1D anteroposterior bioelectric V_mem and morphogen profiles mapped onto 2D dorsal Schmidtea mediterranea body-plan silhouettes and eyespot coordinates; does_not_claim: Single-cell stochastic neoblast migration trajectories or full 3D muscle-fiber extracellular matrix remodeling during blastema outgrowth." ;
        dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
        pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
        pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
        pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: Couple endogenous bioelectric V_mem states to stochastic neoblast division and migration kinetics during blastema outgrowth.",
            "remediation needed: Extend the 1D anteroposterior bioelectric PDE to a 2D finite-element planarian body mesh to model mediolateral slit/netrin axonal guidance of photoreceptor nerves." ;
        pk:hasScore "0.911"^^xsd:double ;
        pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> a pk:Model ;
        rdfs:label "Gemini 4 Argon (primary) + Claude Sonnet 5.5 High (independent second assessor)" ;
        dct:identifier "gemini-4-argon" ;
        prov:actedOnBehalfOf <https://orcid.org/0009-0007-4948-9192> ;
        foaf:homepage <https://deepmind.google> .
}

